title: "Coiling Shells: Form and Colour"
abstract: >-
  Interactive 3D explorer of the theoretical morphology of coiled shells, based
  on David M. Raup's shell-coiling model and Hans Meinhardt's reaction–diffusion
  models of shell pigmentation, with export to images, PDF and 3D printing.
